    "title": "Zelivonic",
    "description": "Zelivonic is an application that focuses on helping users grow, where you can develop your OKR, todo list, future letters\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n-Make OKR, a set of management tools and methods to clarify your goals and their completion, set OKR management for yourself, you can make your goals more clear\r\n\r\n-Lightweight todo, where you can easily and quickly set small tasks, complete and delete it\r\n\r\n-Future letter, you can write a letter for your future self, you can open it years later to see if the goals and ideals you once set are achieved\r\n\r\n-We also provide a weather system, where you can easily check the weather of the day\r\n\r\n\r\nMore small features will be added in the future, so come and experience it!",
